{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I need to head home......This must be the place I want to return to.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Path Home&quot; is a mysterious\u00a0puzzle game with a 2D pixel-art style, where you gradually transform a mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can use panels to &quot;<strong>flip</strong>&quot; between black and white.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/ab5a166bf08b375bfd104bb1626df28f.poster.avif?t=1759509305\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/ab5a166bf08b375bfd104bb1626df28f.webm?t=1759509305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/ab5a166bf08b375bfd104bb1626df28f.mp4?t=1759509305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl is focused on going home, so she\u2019s always looking for the &quot;<strong>shortest route to the goal</strong>.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s up to you to reshape the puzzle world and guide her to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if there are <strong>fake goals</strong>, she might get fooled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block the fake paths or steer her away from them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/7602e810d65ae5c3ebffe3ecdd66cb25.poster.avif?t=1759509305\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/7602e810d65ae5c3ebffe3ecdd66cb25.webm?t=1759509305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/7602e810d65ae5c3ebffe3ecdd66cb25.mp4?t=1759509305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/fd9ef3db2179897245b67879baac107c.poster.avif?t=1759509305\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/fd9ef3db2179897245b67879baac107c.webm?t=1759509305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/fd9ef3db2179897245b67879baac107c.mp4?t=1759509305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>crow</strong> is your friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lead the girl on a detour to help her reunite with the crow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/8aecb8e6aec12bdda978a011c9afc6ad.poster.avif?t=1759509305\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/8aecb8e6aec12bdda978a011c9afc6ad.webm?t=1759509305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/8aecb8e6aec12bdda978a011c9afc6ad.mp4?t=1759509305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tiles you flip aren\u2019t limited to black and white \u2014 new types will appear as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the girl with your &quot;flips&quot; and help 